{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6d14a25f-bfc5-88b2-bcaf-dc81471e4355",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T11:02:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Well, it's almost noon now, isn't it. I'm calling about a dip in the road. Again. Well, not again, I mean I just keep hitting it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dip in the road. Can you tell me where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 167 Narragansett Avenue. That's in the Fifth Ward. My family has lived on this street four generations, so I know every bump on it, and this one is new."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "167 Narragansett Avenue. And what's causing it, do you know, or what does it look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They dug a trench for some utility work, and then they patched it, and now it's settled. So there's a dip where the patch is. Sinking, like. Every car that goes by goes bump, and my tenants complain to me like I run the road department. [pause] Sorry, what was I saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You were telling me about the settled trench. About how big is the dip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, about two feet across. Not huge, but you feel it. Wait, is that wide or long? Ha, it's about two feet across, and longer than that the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, two feet across. So a settled utility trench patch in front of 167 Narragansett. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So can you put the street on the repair list? I'm sick of calling about this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add it to the list for the crews to look at. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:02:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0190. Got it. Name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:02:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Helena Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Resendes. It's in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, dear. Bye now."
    }
  ],
